1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,915
Video ya leo inahusu nini? Ni kuhusu jinsi ya kufanya kazi ya muda.

2
00:00:09,915 --> 00:00:11,415
Sehemu ya 1: Salamu za Kwanza na kujitambulisha

3
00:00:11,415 --> 00:00:13,581
Karibu.

4
00:00:13,604 --> 00:00:16,046
Habari za asubuhi.

5
00:00:16,069 --> 00:00:18,736
Habari za asubuhi.

6
00:00:18,759 --> 00:00:21,770
Leo ndio siku yako ya kwanza katika kazi ya muda, sawa?

7
00:00:21,794 --> 00:00:25,127
Nitakuwa nikifanya kazi kuanzia leo.

8
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:27,684
Tafadhali nisaidie.

9
00:00:27,707 --> 00:00:30,119
Tafadhali nisaidie.

10
00:00:30,143 --> 00:00:32,919
Jina lako ni nani?

11
00:00:32,943 --> 00:00:36,343
Jina langu ni Ali.

12
00:00:36,366 --> 00:00:39,185
Nimetoka Malaysia.

13
00:00:39,208 --> 00:00:41,608
Ali, sawa?

14
00:00:41,631 --> 00:00:44,507
Mimi ni Tanaka.

15
00:00:44,531 --> 00:00:48,418
Mimi ni meneja wa duka hili.

16
00:00:48,442 --> 00:00:52,290
Meneja Tanaka, tafadhali nisaidie.

17
00:00:52,313 --> 00:00:55,648
Umekuja Japani lini?

18
00:00:55,672 --> 00:00:58,205
Nimekuja mwezi uliopita.

19
00:00:58,228 --> 00:01:02,428
Sasa ni mwanafunzi katika shule ya Kijapani.

20
00:01:02,451 --> 00:01:04,618
Ndiyo hivyo.

21
00:01:04,641 --> 00:01:07,841
Unazungumza Kijapani vizuri sana!

22
00:01:07,864 --> 00:01:11,906
Hapana, bado ninafanya mazoezi.

23
00:01:11,930 --> 00:01:15,931
Ninasoma kwa bidii kila siku.

24
00:01:15,955 --> 00:01:19,322
Je, ni mara yako ya kwanza kufanya kazi ya muda?

25
00:01:19,345 --> 00:01:20,994
Ndiyo.

26
00:01:21,017 --> 00:01:24,951
Ni mara yangu ya kwanza kufanya kazi ya muda hapa Japani.

27
00:01:24,974 --> 00:01:28,017
Nina wasiwasi kidogo.

28
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:30,517
Hakuna matata.

29
00:01:30,541 --> 00:01:33,815
Wote wanapokuwa wanaanza, huwa na wasiwasi.

30
00:01:33,838 --> 00:01:35,572
Ndiyo.

31
00:01:35,595 --> 00:01:38,331
Lakini nitajitahidi.

32
00:01:38,355 --> 00:01:42,133
Kwa nini ulichagua kufanya kazi katika duka hili?

33
00:01:42,156 --> 00:01:47,522
Nataka kuanzisha kampuni yangu hapa Japani siku za usoni.

34
00:01:47,545 --> 00:01:53,161
Kwa hiyo, nataka kujifunza biashara za Japani katika duka hili.

35
00:01:53,185 --> 00:01:56,659
Ndoto nzuri sana!

36
00:01:56,683 --> 00:02:01,449
Kuna kazi nyingi katika duka hili.

37
00:02:01,472 --> 00:02:03,039
Ndiyo.

38
00:02:03,062 --> 00:02:06,932
Nataka kujifunza kazi nyingi.

39
00:02:06,956 --> 00:02:11,040
Kuna huduma kwa wateja, kazi ya kwenye kasregister, na kuweka bidhaa kwenye rafu.

40
00:02:11,063 --> 00:02:15,863
Inaonekana ngumu, lakini pia inaonekana ya kuvutia.

41
00:02:15,886 --> 00:02:17,486
Ndiyo.

42
00:02:17,509 --> 00:02:21,985
Kwanza, tuanze na salamu za nguvu.

43
00:02:22,008 --> 00:02:23,707
Ndiyo.

44
00:02:23,731 --> 00:02:26,508
Nitakuwa nikitoa salamu kwa nguvu.

45
00:02:26,532 --> 00:02:31,798
Sasa nitakupatia sare ya kazi, Ali.

46
00:02:31,821 --> 00:02:33,497
Asante sana.

47
00:02:33,521 --> 00:02:36,454
Ukubwa wa nguo ni gani?

48
00:02:36,477 --> 00:02:38,746
Je, ukubwa wa M?

49
00:02:38,769 --> 00:02:40,785
Je, ukubwa wa L?

50
00:02:40,809 --> 00:02:43,778
Nitapenda ukubwa wa L, tafadhali.

51
00:02:43,801 --> 00:02:45,801
Sawa, nimeelewa.

52
00:02:45,824 --> 00:02:48,105
Tafadhali njoo hapa.

53
00:02:48,129 --> 00:02:49,562
Ndiyo.

54
00:02:49,585 --> 00:02:51,718
Samahani.

55
00:02:51,741 --> 00:03:00,750
Skripu ya video ya leo inaweza kupakuliwa kutoka maelezo na maoni ya juu.

56
00:03:00,750 --> 00:03:02,250
Sehemu ya 2: Jinsi ya Kutumia Chumba cha Pumziko cha Wafanyakazi

57
00:03:02,250 --> 00:03:06,650
Ali, hii ni chumba cha kupumzika kwa wafanyakazi.

58
00:03:06,673 --> 00:03:09,907
Sawa. Hii ndiyo chumba cha kupumzika, hivi?

59
00:03:09,930 --> 00:03:14,580
Ndiyo. Weka mizigo yako kwenye rafu pale.

60
00:03:14,603 --> 00:03:16,536
Sawa, nimeelewa.

61
00:03:16,559 --> 00:03:19,526
Rafu ile ya buluu?

62
00:03:19,549 --> 00:03:23,168
Hapana, siyo rafu ile ya buluu.

63
00:03:23,191 --> 00:03:25,625
Rafu nyeupe iliyo karibu nayo.

64
00:03:25,648 --> 00:03:29,528
Aa, rafu ile nyeupe, ndiyo.

65
00:03:29,551 --> 00:03:31,805
Sawa, nimeelewa.

66
00:03:31,829 --> 00:03:36,429
Kuna funguo, kwa hiyo weka vitu muhimu ndani ya mfuko wako.

67
00:03:36,452 --> 00:03:40,509
Sawa. Nimeiweka ndani ya mfuko.

68
00:03:40,532 --> 00:03:43,384
Funguo hii ni ya nani?

69
00:03:43,407 --> 00:03:46,289
Hiyo ni funguo yangu.

70
00:03:46,313 --> 00:03:49,088
Usiguse hiyo, tafadhali.

71
00:03:49,111 --> 00:03:52,278
Samahani. Nimeelewa.

72
00:03:52,301 --> 00:03:55,039
Funguo yako ni hii, Ali.

73
00:03:55,063 --> 00:03:56,902
Tumia hii.

74
00:03:56,926 --> 00:03:58,659
Asante sana.

75
00:03:58,682 --> 00:04:01,493
Hii ndiyo funguo yangu, basi?

76
00:04:01,517 --> 00:04:05,083
Ndiyo. Usipoteze, tafadhali.

77
00:04:05,106 --> 00:04:07,673
Sawa. Nitahifadhi vizuri.

78
00:04:07,696 --> 00:04:11,296
Kisha, hii ni sare yako, Ali.

79
00:04:11,319 --> 00:04:15,092
Waa, sare hii ni nzuri sana!

80
00:04:15,116 --> 00:04:17,282
Kuna kofia pia.

81
00:04:17,305 --> 00:04:19,182
Waweke hii pia.

82
00:04:19,205 --> 00:04:22,572
Sawa. Nitaweka kofia pia.

83
00:04:22,595 --> 00:04:25,873
Nitavaa sare hii wapi?

84
00:04:25,897 --> 00:04:28,464
Chumba cha kubadilisha nguo kiko pale.

85
00:04:28,487 --> 00:04:31,053
Chumba hicho ni cha kubadilisha nguo.

86
00:04:31,076 --> 00:04:32,743
Sawa, nimeelewa.

87
00:04:32,766 --> 00:04:35,432
Chumba chini ya mlango ule, ndiyo?

88
00:04:35,455 --> 00:04:38,022
Ndiyo, ndivyo.

89
00:04:38,045 --> 00:04:40,055
Kuna bango la jina pia.

90
00:04:40,079 --> 00:04:42,612
Hili ni bango lako, Ali.

91
00:04:42,635 --> 00:04:44,438
Asante sana.

92
00:04:44,462 --> 00:04:47,337
Ninaweka bango hili wapi?

93
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:51,493
Weka bango upande wa kushoto wa nguo yako.

94
00:04:51,516 --> 00:04:53,794
Upande wa kushoto wa nguo, ndiyo.

95
00:04:53,818 --> 00:04:58,351
Je, kiatu hiki ni cha nani, Meneja?

96
00:04:58,374 --> 00:05:01,374
Hicho ni kiatu cha mwandamizi wako.

97
00:05:01,397 --> 00:05:04,364
Viatu vyako viko huko, Ali.

98
00:05:04,387 --> 00:05:07,387
Aa, vipo hapa.

99
00:05:07,410 --> 00:05:09,376
Vizuri sana.

100
00:05:09,399 --> 00:05:11,411
Uko tayari?

101
00:05:11,435 --> 00:05:14,435
Ndiyo, nitarudi baada ya kubadilisha nguo.

102
00:05:14,458 --> 00:05:21,563
Kiungo cha kurudia maelezo ya video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kuondolewa bila tahadhari.

103
00:05:21,563 --> 00:05:23,063
Sehemu ya 3: Maelezo ya Kazi ya Msaada / Utangulizi wa Kazi ya Msaada

104
00:05:23,063 --> 00:05:28,063
Ali, sare inakufaa sana!

105
00:05:28,086 --> 00:05:29,935
Asante sana.

106
00:05:29,958 --> 00:05:32,891
Ninahisi aibu kidogo.

107
00:05:32,914 --> 00:05:37,847
Sasa, nitakueleza kuhusu kanuni za duka na ratiba.

108
00:05:37,870 --> 00:05:40,004
Sawa. Tafadhali nisaidie.

109
00:05:40,027 --> 00:05:47,793
Kazi yako ya msaada itakuwa kila Jumatatu, Jumatano na Ijumaa.

110
00:05:47,816 --> 00:05:51,950
Jumatatu, Jumatano na Ijumaa, ndiyo.

111
00:05:51,973 --> 00:05:53,810
Sawa, nimeelewa.

112
00:05:53,833 --> 00:05:59,474
Muda wa kazi ni kutoka saa kumi za jioni hadi saa tatu usiku.

113
00:05:59,497 --> 00:06:01,977
Kutoka saa kumi za jioni hadi saa tatu usiku, ndiyo.

114
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:06,842
Ndio. Tafadhali njoo dukani dakika tano kabla ya saa kumi.

115
00:06:06,866 --> 00:06:09,558
Dakika tano kabla ya saa kumi, sawa?

116
00:06:09,581 --> 00:06:12,148
Sitachelewa.

117
00:06:12,171 --> 00:06:14,626
Ni vizuri sana!

118
00:06:14,649 --> 00:06:17,662
Kuna muda wa mapumziko?

119
00:06:17,685 --> 00:06:22,918
Eeh, baada ya kufanya kazi saa ngapi kuna mapumziko?

120
00:06:22,941 --> 00:06:29,024
Hapa dukani, baada ya kufanya kazi saa tano, una mapumziko ya dakika thelathini.

121
00:06:29,048 --> 00:06:32,688
Mapumziko ya dakika thelathini, sawa?

122
00:06:32,711 --> 00:06:35,391
Mapumziko ni saa ngapi?

123
00:06:35,415 --> 00:06:38,451
Inategemea siku.

124
00:06:38,475 --> 00:06:42,445
Kwa kawaida ni saa kumi na mbili au moja.

125
00:06:42,468 --> 00:06:44,235
Sawa, nimeelewa.

126
00:06:44,258 --> 00:06:47,991
Je, wakati wa mapumziko napata mshahara?

127
00:06:48,014 --> 00:06:52,492
Hapana, wakati wa mapumziko huna mshahara.

128
00:06:52,515 --> 00:06:54,764
Sawa, nimeelewa.

129
00:06:54,788 --> 00:06:57,322
Mshahara kwa saa ni kiasi gani?

130
00:06:57,345 --> 00:07:01,078
Mshahara kwa saa ni yen 1,200.

131
00:07:01,101 --> 00:07:03,793
Yen 1,200 kwa saa?

132
00:07:03,817 --> 00:07:05,983
Ni pesa nyingi!

133
00:07:06,006 --> 00:07:08,075
Ninashangilia!

134
00:07:08,099 --> 00:07:12,434
Siku ya mshahara ni tarehe ishirini na tano kila mwezi.

135
00:07:12,458 --> 00:07:16,191
Tutaweka pesa katika akaunti yako ya benki.

136
00:07:16,214 --> 00:07:18,481
Tarehe ishirini na tano, sawa?

137
00:07:18,504 --> 00:07:21,984
Akaunti yangu ni ya benki ya Mizuho.

138
00:07:22,007 --> 00:07:23,879
Sawa, nimeelewa.

139
00:07:23,902 --> 00:07:26,985
Baadaye, tafadhali jaza fomu.

140
00:07:27,009 --> 00:07:28,642
Ndiyo.

141
00:07:28,665 --> 00:07:30,754
Nitajaza leo.

142
00:07:30,777 --> 00:07:33,777
Una maswali yoyote?

143
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:36,371
Kuna kazi za ziada?

144
00:07:36,395 --> 00:07:40,362
Kwa kawaida hakuna kazi za ziada.

145
00:07:40,385 --> 00:07:43,868
Unaweza kwenda nyumbani wakati wa saa zako.

146
00:07:43,891 --> 00:07:45,658
Nimefarijika.

147
00:07:45,681 --> 00:07:48,418
Asante sana.

148
00:07:48,441 --> 00:07:49,941
Sehemu ya 4: Utangulizi wa sehemu ya nyuma ya duka

149
00:07:49,941 --> 00:07:54,032
Leo tutaanza kwa kuonyesha sehemu ya nyuma ya duka.

150
00:07:54,056 --> 00:07:56,499
Sehemu ya nyuma ya duka, sawa?

151
00:07:56,522 --> 00:07:59,522
Hii ni pana sana!

152
00:07:59,545 --> 00:08:01,112
Ndiyo.

153
00:08:01,135 --> 00:08:05,135
Kuna bidhaa nyingi hapa.

154
00:08:05,158 --> 00:08:09,424
Kule kuna vinywaji vingi!

155
00:08:09,448 --> 00:08:11,681
Ndio.

156
00:08:11,704 --> 00:08:16,319
Huko ni ghala ya vinywaji baridi.

157
00:08:16,342 --> 00:08:20,309
Vinywaji vya moto viko wapi?

158
00:08:20,332 --> 00:08:27,765
Vinywaji vya moto viko ndani ya boksi dogo huko.

159
00:08:27,788 --> 00:08:30,859
Aa, ndani ya boksi ile, sawa?

160
00:08:30,882 --> 00:08:33,016
Sawa, nimeelewa.

161
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:37,519
Kisha, tutaeleza mahali pa kutupa taka.

162
00:08:37,543 --> 00:08:40,815
Takataka zinatupwa wapi?

163
00:08:40,839 --> 00:08:46,258
Eeh, kule kuna mtungo wa takataka mweusi.

164
00:08:46,282 --> 00:08:48,348
Ndio.

165
00:08:48,371 --> 00:08:52,654
Lakini huo ni kwa takataka zinazotumika.

166
00:08:52,678 --> 00:08:57,090
Mtungo wa chupa za plastiki uko wapi?

167
00:08:57,113 --> 00:09:03,113
Mtungo wa chupa za plastiki uko karibu nao.

168
00:09:03,136 --> 00:09:06,936
Aa, huu ni mtungo mweupe, sawa?

169
00:09:06,959 --> 00:09:08,559
Ndiyo.

170
00:09:08,582 --> 00:09:13,760
Nchini Japani, kutenganisha takataka ni muhimu sana.

171
00:09:13,784 --> 00:09:15,350
Ndiyo.

172
00:09:15,373 --> 00:09:19,783
Ni kali zaidi kuliko Malaysia, nitahadhari.

173
00:09:19,807 --> 00:09:25,007
Pia, kule kuna makasi na kalamu.

174
00:09:25,030 --> 00:09:27,463
Je, una tepu pia?

175
00:09:27,486 --> 00:09:32,133
Ndiyo, tepu zipo kwenye rafu ile juu.

176
00:09:32,157 --> 00:09:34,031
Sawa, nimeelewa.

177
00:09:34,054 --> 00:09:37,188
Zana hizi hutumika kazini.

178
00:09:37,211 --> 00:09:39,477
Ndio.

179
00:09:39,500 --> 00:09:44,307
Baada ya kutumia, rudisha mahali pake pa awali.

180
00:09:44,330 --> 00:09:48,297
Nitarudisha mahali pake pa awali.

181
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:52,955
Halafu, angalia mashine pale.

182
00:09:52,979 --> 00:09:56,745
Mashine ile kubwa ni nini?

183
00:09:56,768 --> 00:10:01,102
Hiyo ni skrini ya kamera ya usalama.

184
00:10:01,125 --> 00:10:05,392
Kuna kamera nyingi ndani ya duka.

185
00:10:05,415 --> 00:10:08,874
Eeh, zipo nyingi sana!

186
00:10:08,898 --> 00:10:12,098
Ni muhimu kwa ajili ya usalama.

187
00:10:12,121 --> 00:10:16,172
Ndiyo, ni kweli kabisa.

188
00:10:16,195 --> 00:10:20,595
Sasa, twende ndani ya duka.

189
00:10:20,619 --> 00:10:23,819
Ndiyo, twende.

190
00:10:23,842 --> 00:10:25,342
Maelezo ya Sehemu ya 5: Misingi ya Huduma kwa Wateja: Salamu na Tabasamu

191
00:10:25,342 --> 00:10:29,709
Ali, hapa ni eneo la duka.

192
00:10:29,732 --> 00:10:30,732
Ndiyo.

193
00:10:30,755 --> 00:10:34,488
Kuna wateja wengi sana!

194
00:10:34,511 --> 00:10:39,783
Unadhani nini ni kitu muhimu zaidi katika huduma kwa wateja?

195
00:10:39,806 --> 00:10:43,940
Hmm, labda tabasamu?

196
00:10:43,963 --> 00:10:46,563
Sahihi!

197
00:10:46,586 --> 00:10:51,552
Tabasamu na salamu kwa sauti kubwa ni muhimu.

198
00:10:51,575 --> 00:10:52,909
Ndiyo.

199
00:10:52,932 --> 00:10:56,065
Ningependa kufanya mazoezi ya salamu.

200
00:10:56,088 --> 00:10:59,580
Sasa, fuata mfano wangu.

201
00:10:59,603 --> 00:11:01,578
Karibu.

202
00:11:01,602 --> 00:11:03,970
Karibu.

203
00:11:03,993 --> 00:11:05,760
Vizuri sana.

204
00:11:05,783 --> 00:11:10,584
Lakini, ongeza sauti kidogo tafadhali.

205
00:11:10,608 --> 00:11:12,851
Karibu.

206
00:11:12,874 --> 00:11:15,010
Vizuri kabisa.

207
00:11:15,034 --> 00:11:19,367
Sasa tutazungumza kuhusu salamu wakati wa malipo.

208
00:11:19,390 --> 00:11:21,123
Asante sana.

209
00:11:21,146 --> 00:11:22,780
Asante sana.

210
00:11:22,803 --> 00:11:26,877
Sauti yako ni safi sana na nzuri kabisa.

211
00:11:26,900 --> 00:11:28,900
Asante sana.

212
00:11:28,923 --> 00:11:31,021
Ninashangilia!

213
00:11:31,045 --> 00:11:35,650
Mteja anapokuja dukani, unasemaje?

214
00:11:35,673 --> 00:11:39,273
Unasema, "Karibu."

215
00:11:39,296 --> 00:11:43,535
Mteja anapotoka dukani, unasemaje?

216
00:11:43,558 --> 00:11:46,292
Unasema, "Asante sana."

217
00:11:46,315 --> 00:11:48,395
Umefanya vizuri sana.

218
00:11:48,418 --> 00:11:51,352
Salamu zako zinafaa kabisa.

219
00:11:51,375 --> 00:11:53,408
Vizuri sana.

220
00:11:53,431 --> 00:11:56,031
Nimepata kidogo ya ujasiri.

221
00:11:56,054 --> 00:12:02,821
Mteja anapotafuta kitu, unasema, "Unautafuta nini?"

222
00:12:02,844 --> 00:12:05,377
Unautafuta nini?

223
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:09,090
Ni ngumu kidogo, lakini nitakumbuka.

224
00:12:09,114 --> 00:12:12,364
Usiharakishe, hakuna haraka.

225
00:12:12,388 --> 00:12:14,721
Tukumbuke polepole.

226
00:12:14,744 --> 00:12:16,077
Ndiyo.

227
00:12:16,100 --> 00:12:19,786
Kila siku nitasema salamu kwa sauti kubwa.

228
00:12:19,809 --> 00:12:24,876
Sauti ya furaha ya Ali inafanya duka liwe na nguvu.

229
00:12:24,900 --> 00:12:26,593
Asante sana.

230
00:12:26,616 --> 00:12:28,788
Nitapigania.

231
00:12:28,812 --> 00:12:30,312
Sehemu ya 6: Jinsi ya Kutumia Kasregister / Jinsi ya Kutumia Kasregister

232
00:12:30,312 --> 00:12:34,520
Sasa, tutaanza kufundisha kuhusu kazi ya kasregister.

233
00:12:34,543 --> 00:12:38,809
Ndio, nina wasiwasi kidogo, lakini nataka kujaribu.

234
00:12:38,832 --> 00:12:41,432
Hii ni skrini ya kasregister.

235
00:12:41,455 --> 00:12:44,463
Skrini hii ni ya kugusa.

236
00:12:44,487 --> 00:12:47,738
Skrini ni kubwa na rahisi kuona.

237
00:12:47,761 --> 00:12:51,094
Bidhaa zina nambari ya barakoa.

238
00:12:51,117 --> 00:12:54,951
Tafadhali soma barakoa hii kwa mashine hii.

239
00:12:54,974 --> 00:12:58,041
Hutakuwa na sauti ya 'beep'.

240
00:12:58,064 --> 00:13:04,431
Ndiyo, baada ya kusikia sauti, jina la bidhaa na bei yataonekana kwenye skrini.

241
00:13:04,454 --> 00:13:10,338
Aa, kwenye skrini kumeandikwa 'onigiri shilingi 150'.

242
00:13:10,361 --> 00:13:12,331
Ndio.

243
00:13:12,354 --> 00:13:17,887
Baada ya kusoma barakoa zote, bonyeza kitufe cha jumla ndogo.

244
00:13:17,910 --> 00:13:20,510
Kitufe cha jumla ndogo, ndiyo.

245
00:13:20,533 --> 00:13:22,167
Nimebonyeza.

246
00:13:22,190 --> 00:13:25,991
Kisha, umbie mteja kuhusu pesa.

247
00:13:26,014 --> 00:13:29,547
Tafadhali sema, 'Shilingi 150'.

248
00:13:29,570 --> 00:13:32,104
Shilingi 150.

249
00:13:32,127 --> 00:13:34,860
Mteja ameutoa noti ya elfu moja.

250
00:13:34,883 --> 00:13:39,381
Ingiza '1000' kwenye skrini.

251
00:13:39,404 --> 00:13:41,404
1, 0, 0, 0, ndiyo.

252
00:13:41,427 --> 00:13:43,164
Nimeingiza.

253
00:13:43,188 --> 00:13:47,832
Kisha bonyeza kitufe cha malipo ya sasa.

254
00:13:47,855 --> 00:13:49,255
Nimebonyeza.

255
00:13:49,278 --> 00:13:52,512
Aa, kaseti imefunguka.

256
00:13:52,535 --> 00:13:54,901
Pesa ya rudisho ni ngapi?

257
00:13:54,924 --> 00:13:57,561
Tazama skrini.

258
00:13:57,585 --> 00:14:03,119
Kwenye skrini kumeandikwa 'Pesa ya rudisho ni shilingi 850'.

259
00:14:03,142 --> 00:14:06,908
Mpe mteja pesa ya rudisho ya shilingi 850.

260
00:14:06,931 --> 00:14:10,989
Tafadhali hesabu noti na sarafu za pesa ya rudisho.

261
00:14:11,012 --> 00:14:18,812
Kuna sarafu ya shilingi 500 moja, shilingi 100 tatu, na shilingi 50 moja.

262
00:14:18,835 --> 00:14:20,670
Sahihi!

263
00:14:20,694 --> 00:14:25,261
Usichanganye kiasi cha pesa ulilokabidhiwa na pesa ya rudisho, tafadhali.

264
00:14:25,284 --> 00:14:26,817
Ndiyo.

265
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:29,280
Nitatazama nambari vizuri.

266
00:14:29,304 --> 00:14:30,804
Sehemu ya 7: Misingi ya Uthibitishaji wa Malipo / Misingi ya Kuthibitisha Malipo Kwenye Kaseti

267
00:14:30,804 --> 00:14:34,970
Bwana Ali, kazi ya kaseti inakuwaje?

268
00:14:34,993 --> 00:14:38,442
Nimezoea kidogo.

269
00:14:38,466 --> 00:14:43,269
Lakini wakati mwingine nina haraka.

270
00:14:43,293 --> 00:14:46,097
Hakuna matata.

271
00:14:46,121 --> 00:14:51,587
Leo tutajifunza kuhusu uthibitishaji wa malipo wakati wa kulipa.

272
00:14:51,610 --> 00:14:54,810
Sawa, naomba.

273
00:14:54,833 --> 00:15:01,200
Mteja atakapokuja kwenye kaseti, kwanza soma bidhaa.

274
00:15:01,223 --> 00:15:05,693
Ndiyo, hiyo naweza kufanya.

275
00:15:05,717 --> 00:15:11,483
Baada ya hapo, uliza mteja njia ya malipo.

276
00:15:11,506 --> 00:15:14,440
Njia ya malipo?

277
00:15:14,463 --> 00:15:18,200
Ndiyo.

278
00:15:18,223 --> 00:15:20,226
Uliza, 'Je, ni fedha taslimu au kadi?'

279
00:15:20,249 --> 00:15:22,183
Malipo, je ni fedha taslimu au kadi?

280
00:15:22,206 --> 00:15:25,819
Vizuri sana.

281
00:15:25,842 --> 00:15:27,851
Hivi siku hizi kuna malipo kwa simu pia.

282
00:15:27,875 --> 00:15:29,716
Ikiwa ni kwa simu, nifanyeje?

283
00:15:29,739 --> 00:15:34,226
Soma barakoa kwenye skrini ya simu kwa kutumia mashine ya kaseti.

284
00:15:34,250 --> 00:15:38,017
Je, ni sawa na fedha taslimu au kadi?

285
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:44,082
Bonyeza kitufe sawa na kile cha kadi.

286
00:15:44,106 --> 00:15:46,639
Bonyeza kitufe cha malipo kwa barakoa.

287
00:15:46,662 --> 00:15:49,629
Je, ni sawa na fedha taslimu au kadi?

288
00:15:49,652 --> 00:15:53,452
Bonyeza kitufe sawa na kile cha kadi.

289
00:15:53,475 --> 00:15:58,516
Bonyeza kitufe cha malipo kwa barakoa.

290
00:15:58,539 --> 00:16:02,473
Kitufe cha malipo kwa barakoa, ndiyo.

291
00:16:02,496 --> 00:16:04,662
Sawa, nimeelewa.

292
00:16:04,685 --> 00:16:11,019
Mteja atakapotolea kadi, mpeleke aweke kadi hapa.

293
00:16:11,042 --> 00:16:15,208
Mteja huweka mwenyewe?

294
00:16:15,231 --> 00:16:17,842
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

295
00:16:17,866 --> 00:16:20,466
Sisi hatumhisi.

296
00:16:20,489 --> 00:16:22,322
Sawa, nimeelewa.

297
00:16:22,345 --> 00:16:24,712
Ni salama.

298
00:16:24,735 --> 00:16:29,401
Baada ya kumaliza malipo, mpe risiti.

299
00:16:29,424 --> 00:16:32,191
Tafadhali uliza, 'Unahitaji risiti?'

300
00:16:32,214 --> 00:16:34,032
Unahitaji risiti?

301
00:16:34,056 --> 00:16:37,139
Ndiyo.

302
00:16:37,162 --> 00:16:42,296
Wateja wengi husema hawataki risiti.

303
00:16:42,319 --> 00:16:44,085
Sawa, nimeelewa.

304
00:16:44,108 --> 00:16:46,917
Uliza kwa upole.

305
00:16:46,941 --> 00:16:48,441
Mstari wa 8: Huduma kwa Wateja wa Mlo wa Chakula cha Mchana (Bento)

306
00:16:48,441 --> 00:16:54,450
Ali, leo tutazungumzia kuhusu huduma ya wateja kwa malo za chakula cha mchana.

307
00:16:54,473 --> 00:16:57,073
Huduma kwa malo za chakula cha mchana?

308
00:16:57,096 --> 00:16:59,769
Ninapaswa kusema nini?

309
00:16:59,793 --> 00:17:03,041
Je, unataka nikuze chakula chako cha mchana?

310
00:17:03,065 --> 00:17:04,631
ndio nitakaposema.

311
00:17:04,654 --> 00:17:08,096
Je, unataka nikuze chakula chako cha mchana?

312
00:17:08,120 --> 00:17:15,087
Ikiwa mteja atakubali, weka kwenye microwave.

313
00:17:15,110 --> 00:17:18,476
Muda wa microwave ni wa vipi?

314
00:17:18,499 --> 00:17:22,554
Kwenye mfuko wa chakula cha mchana kuna maelezo ya muda.

315
00:17:22,578 --> 00:17:29,073
Kama sekunde hamsini au dakika moja.

316
00:17:29,097 --> 00:17:30,730
Ndiyo.

317
00:17:30,754 --> 00:17:35,687
Kwa sababu ni ya biashara, basi bonyeza kitufe mara moja tu.

318
00:17:35,710 --> 00:17:37,644
Ni rahisi sana!

319
00:17:37,667 --> 00:17:40,933
Baada ya kukiuza, nifanye nini?

320
00:17:40,956 --> 00:17:46,556
Usiaweke chakula cha mchana kizito pamoja na kinywaji baridi katika mfuko mmoja.

321
00:17:46,579 --> 00:17:49,746
Je, ni bora kuwaweka katika mifuko tofauti?

322
00:17:49,769 --> 00:17:52,040
Ndiyo, ndivyo.

323
00:17:52,064 --> 00:17:55,297
Ndiyo, ni bora kuwaweka katika mifuko tofauti.

324
00:17:55,320 --> 00:17:57,087
Sawa, nimeelewa.

325
00:17:57,110 --> 00:17:59,002
Nitakuwa makini.

326
00:17:59,026 --> 00:18:02,793
Kisha, hakikisha mifuko.

327
00:18:02,816 --> 00:18:05,155
Unahitaji mfuko?

328
00:18:05,178 --> 00:18:06,945
ndio nitakaposema.

329
00:18:06,968 --> 00:18:09,135
Unahitaji mfuko?

330
00:18:09,158 --> 00:18:17,024
Siku hizi mifuko inalipishwa, mfuko mkubwa ni shilingi tano na mdogo ni shilingi tatu.

331
00:18:17,047 --> 00:18:19,581
Mifuko inalipishwa, basi.

332
00:18:19,604 --> 00:18:21,937
Inagharimu pesa.

333
00:18:21,960 --> 00:18:23,960
Ndio.

334
00:18:23,983 --> 00:18:30,116
Ikiwa mteja atasema 'Ninahitaji mfuko,' basi bonyeza kitufe cha mfuko.

335
00:18:30,139 --> 00:18:31,940
Sawa, nimeelewa.

336
00:18:31,963 --> 00:18:36,096
Je, wakati wa chakula cha mchana, unaweka na vijiti pia?

337
00:18:36,119 --> 00:18:37,494
Ndiyo.

338
00:18:37,518 --> 00:18:40,157
Unahitaji vijiti?

339
00:18:40,180 --> 00:18:42,025
Tafadhali uliza.

340
00:18:42,049 --> 00:18:44,616
Unahitaji vijiti?

341
00:18:44,639 --> 00:18:47,494
Je, unahitaji kijiko pia?

342
00:18:47,517 --> 00:18:51,751
Wakati wa karai au doria, weka kijiko.

343
00:18:51,774 --> 00:18:55,907
Angalia bidhaa na uamuze kati ya vijiti au kijiko.

344
00:18:55,930 --> 00:18:57,430
Mstari wa 9: Chagua Onigiri

345
00:18:57,430 --> 00:18:59,397
Karibu.

346
00:18:59,420 --> 00:19:01,557
Karibu.

347
00:19:01,581 --> 00:19:06,548
Eeh, mteja, unautafuta kitu?

348
00:19:06,571 --> 00:19:08,740
Samahani.

349
00:19:08,764 --> 00:19:11,764
Ninataka kununua onigiri.

350
00:19:11,787 --> 00:19:14,787
Ni ipi tamu zaidi?

351
00:19:14,810 --> 00:19:19,576
Dukani hapa kuna aina nyingi za onigiri.

352
00:19:19,599 --> 00:19:23,633
Onigiri gani ni maarufu zaidi?

353
00:19:23,656 --> 00:19:28,193
Onigiri ya samaki salmon ndiyo maarufu zaidi.

354
00:19:28,217 --> 00:19:30,693
Ni tamu sana!

355
00:19:30,716 --> 00:19:32,806
Samaki?

356
00:19:32,830 --> 00:19:34,996
Vizuri sana.

357
00:19:35,019 --> 00:19:38,253
Je, kuna zingine zipi?

358
00:19:38,276 --> 00:19:42,565
Kuna ume, kombu, na tuna mayonnaise.

359
00:19:42,588 --> 00:19:45,421
Tuna mayonnaise ni tamu?

360
00:19:45,444 --> 00:19:47,278
Ndiyo.

361
00:19:47,301 --> 00:19:52,956
Tuna mayonnaise ni maarufu baada ya samaki salmon.

362
00:19:52,980 --> 00:19:55,413
Ni maarufu kwa vijana.

363
00:19:55,436 --> 00:19:58,836
Napenda mayonnaise.

364
00:19:58,859 --> 00:20:01,526
Nitachagua tuna mayonnaise.

365
00:20:01,548 --> 00:20:03,588
Asante sana.

366
00:20:03,612 --> 00:20:06,269
Hii ni tuna mayonnaise, basi.

367
00:20:06,293 --> 00:20:09,972
Una onigiri yenye pilipili?

368
00:20:09,995 --> 00:20:13,929
Onigiri ya mentaiko ni kidogo kali.

369
00:20:13,952 --> 00:20:15,952
Mentaiko?

370
00:20:15,975 --> 00:20:18,645
Hiyo pia inaonekana kuwa tamu.

371
00:20:18,668 --> 00:20:23,082
Mentaiko na tuna mayonnaise, upendelea ipi?

372
00:20:23,106 --> 00:20:26,072
Leo nitachukua tuna mayonnaise.

373
00:20:26,095 --> 00:20:28,187
Sawa, nimeelewa.

374
00:20:28,211 --> 00:20:29,944
Asante sana.

375
00:20:29,967 --> 00:20:32,934
Malipo yako tafadhali hapa.

376
00:20:32,957 --> 00:20:34,647
Ndiyo.

377
00:20:34,671 --> 00:20:37,007
Haitaji mfuko.

378
00:20:37,030 --> 00:20:39,697
Haitaji mfuko, basi.

379
00:20:39,720 --> 00:20:41,787
Asante sana.

380
00:20:41,810 --> 00:20:43,777
Shilingi mia moja na hamsini.

381
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:45,047
Ndiyo.

382
00:20:45,070 --> 00:20:47,804
Shilingi mia moja na hamsini.

383
00:20:47,827 --> 00:20:50,193
Nitakupokea pesa kamili.

384
00:20:50,216 --> 00:20:52,074
Asante sana.

385
00:20:52,097 --> 00:20:54,166
Asante.

386
00:20:54,190 --> 00:20:55,690
Sehemu ya 10: Huduma kwa Mteja na Nambari za Sigara

387
00:20:55,690 --> 00:21:01,870
Ali, huduma uliyotoa hapo awali ilikuwa nzuri sana.

388
00:21:01,893 --> 00:21:03,512
Asante sana.

389
00:21:03,535 --> 00:21:07,702
Ufafanuzi wako kuhusu onigiri ulikuwa wa kuvutia.

390
00:21:07,725 --> 00:21:12,858
Karibu na kasari kuna rafu ya sigara, sivyo?

391
00:21:12,881 --> 00:21:16,895
Ndio, kuna sigara nyingi.

392
00:21:16,919 --> 00:21:22,174
Wateja hawawezi kuchukua sigara wenyewe.

393
00:21:22,197 --> 00:21:25,274
Je, sisi ndio tutachukua?

394
00:21:25,298 --> 00:21:30,236
Ndio, kila sigara ina nambari yake.

395
00:21:30,259 --> 00:21:33,926
Kuna nambari kutoka moja hadi mia.

396
00:21:33,948 --> 00:21:37,951
Mteja huwa anasema nambari?

397
00:21:37,975 --> 00:21:43,575
Ndio, anasema 'Nitakaye sigara nambari tano, tafadhali.'

398
00:21:43,598 --> 00:21:45,931
Nambari tano, basi.

399
00:21:45,954 --> 00:21:49,087
Inaonekana kuwa ngumu kutafuta.

400
00:21:49,110 --> 00:21:55,969
Nambari zimepangwa kutoka kushoto kwa mpangilio, kwa hivyo ni rahisi kupata.

401
00:21:55,992 --> 00:21:57,992
Sawa, nimeelewa.

402
00:21:58,015 --> 00:22:00,501
Nitafuta kwa utulivu.

403
00:22:00,525 --> 00:22:05,564
Unapouza sigara, kuna jambo muhimu zaidi.

404
00:22:05,587 --> 00:22:07,554
Ni nini?

405
00:22:07,578 --> 00:22:10,857
Kuthibitisha umri.

406
00:22:10,880 --> 00:22:16,370
Nchini Japani, unaweza kununua sigara kuanzia umri wa ishirini.

407
00:22:16,394 --> 00:22:18,372
Umri wa ishirini, basi.

408
00:22:18,395 --> 00:22:21,462
Hii ni tofauti na Malaysia.

409
00:22:21,485 --> 00:22:27,698
Mteja akiwa na umri mdogo, mpeleke kwa kitufe cha kuthibitisha kwenye skrini.

410
00:22:27,721 --> 00:22:32,521
Je, nawaambia 'Bonyeza kitufe kwenye skrini'?

411
00:22:32,544 --> 00:22:35,311
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

412
00:22:35,334 --> 00:22:39,934
Mwambie 'Tafadhali gusa skrini.'

413
00:22:39,957 --> 00:22:43,334
Tafadhali gusa skrini.

414
00:22:43,358 --> 00:22:45,758
Kamili.

415
00:22:45,781 --> 00:22:49,876
Ni sheria, kwa hivyo ni muhimu sana.

416
00:22:49,900 --> 00:22:51,733
Ndiyo.

417
00:22:51,756 --> 00:22:54,249
Sitakosea kamwe.

418
00:22:54,273 --> 00:22:55,773
Sehemu ya 11: Kazi ya Snacki za Moto Kando ya Kasari

419
00:22:55,773 --> 00:23:02,740
Ali, sasa ni kazi ya snacki za moto kando ya kasari.

420
00:23:02,763 --> 00:23:06,829
Ndio, kuku na koroke, sivyo?

421
00:23:06,852 --> 00:23:09,019
Ndio.

422
00:23:09,042 --> 00:23:17,642
Mteja akisema 'Nitakaye kuku,' tumia tongu kuziweka kwenye mfuko.

423
00:23:17,665 --> 00:23:21,282
Ndio, nitatumia tongu.

424
00:23:21,305 --> 00:23:27,114
Pia, usikose kuuliza mteja 'Unahitaji sosu?'

425
00:23:27,137 --> 00:23:30,032
Usikose kuuliza.

426
00:23:30,056 --> 00:23:34,489
Ndio, nitauliza 'Unahitaji sosu?'

427
00:23:34,512 --> 00:23:36,479
ndio nitakaposema.

428
00:23:36,502 --> 00:23:41,469
Sasa unaponunua kuku, unapata sosu bure.

429
00:23:41,492 --> 00:23:44,466
Ndiyo, ni bure.

430
00:23:44,489 --> 00:23:46,522
Nimeelewa.

431
00:23:46,545 --> 00:23:52,401
Kuku ni maarufu sana, basi ikiwa inakwisha, choma upesi.

432
00:23:52,424 --> 00:23:55,858
Ndiyo, nitachoma upesi.

433
00:23:55,881 --> 00:24:00,847
Kule kuna mashine inayoitwa friyer.

434
00:24:00,870 --> 00:24:03,204
Mashine ile, ndiyo.

435
00:24:03,227 --> 00:24:09,260
Ndiyo, mafuta yamewaka sana, basi angalia kwa makini.

436
00:24:09,283 --> 00:24:13,650
Ndiyo, nitashughulikia kwa uangalifu mkubwa.

437
00:24:13,673 --> 00:24:15,362
Asante sana.

438
00:24:15,385 --> 00:24:19,399
Kazi iliyofanywa kwa uangalifu ni muhimu sana.

439
00:24:19,423 --> 00:24:22,590
Ndiyo, nitajitahidi.

440
00:24:22,612 --> 00:24:26,946
Karepani na koroke pia zinauzwa sana.

441
00:24:26,969 --> 00:24:30,302
Karepani na koroke, ndiyo.

442
00:24:30,325 --> 00:24:32,815
Nitapanga kwa wingi.

443
00:24:32,839 --> 00:24:38,972
Mteja akiagiza, usichanganye bidhaa, tafadhali.

444
00:24:38,995 --> 00:24:42,228
Ndiyo, nitathibitisha.

445
00:24:42,251 --> 00:24:44,619
Hakuna matata.

446
00:24:44,643 --> 00:24:48,125
Ali, tayari umezoea, sivyo?

447
00:24:48,148 --> 00:24:51,148
Ndiyo, asante.

448
00:24:51,171 --> 00:24:54,910
Kazi ya hoti snack ni ya furaha.

449
00:24:54,933 --> 00:25:00,029
Basi, sasa tutacheza jinsi ya kuchoma.

450
00:25:00,053 --> 00:25:02,819
Ndiyo, tafadhali niongoze.

451
00:25:02,842 --> 00:25:07,289
Joto la mafuta ni mia moja na themanini digrii.

452
00:25:07,313 --> 00:25:11,368
Ndiyo, mia moja na themanini digrii.

453
00:25:11,392 --> 00:25:13,397
Nitakumbuka.

454
00:25:13,421 --> 00:25:14,921
Sehemu ya 12: Ukaguzi wa Vijiti na Spooni kwa Agizo la Mlo wa Chakula cha Mchana

455
00:25:14,921 --> 00:25:22,087
Ali, katika huduma ya wateja wa mlo wa chakula cha mchana, tutathibitisha kuhusu vijiti na spooni.

456
00:25:22,110 --> 00:25:25,944
Ndiyo, vijiti na spooni.

457
00:25:25,967 --> 00:25:28,200
Ndio.

458
00:25:28,223 --> 00:25:35,037
Mteja anayenunua mlo wa chakula cha mchana, umuulize, "Je, unahitaji vijiti?"

459
00:25:35,060 --> 00:25:39,951
Ndiyo, nitamuuliza, "Je, unahitaji vijiti?"

460
00:25:39,974 --> 00:25:46,058
Kama ni karai au doria, umwambie, "Je, unahitaji spooni?"

461
00:25:46,082 --> 00:25:51,657
Ndiyo, "Je, unahitaji spooni?"

462
00:25:51,680 --> 00:25:53,949
Ndio.

463
00:25:53,973 --> 00:25:59,173
Kwenye mfuko wa mlo wa chakula cha mchana, weka vijiti moja.

464
00:25:59,196 --> 00:26:02,648
Ndiyo, nitaiweka moja.

465
00:26:02,671 --> 00:26:06,271
Kama ni chakula cha noodles, vijiti vya kuvunja ni bora.

466
00:26:06,294 --> 00:26:08,567
Vijiti vya kuvunja, ndiyo.

467
00:26:08,591 --> 00:26:10,725
Sawa, nimeelewa.

468
00:26:10,748 --> 00:26:16,581
Mteja akiwa wawili, weka vijiti viwili.

469
00:26:16,604 --> 00:26:19,872
Ndiyo, nitaviweka viwili.

470
00:26:19,895 --> 00:26:25,062
Wakati mwingine kuna wateja wasiohitaji vijiti.

471
00:26:25,085 --> 00:26:28,983
Ndiyo, wakati huo nifanye nini?

472
00:26:29,007 --> 00:26:34,613
Akisema, "Sihitaji vijiti," usiweke.

473
00:26:34,636 --> 00:26:38,040
Ndiyo, nisiiweke.

474
00:26:38,064 --> 00:26:42,231
Kwa sababu mara nyingi husahau, angalia kwa makini.

475
00:26:42,254 --> 00:26:45,420
Ndiyo, nitakuwa makini.

476
00:26:45,443 --> 00:26:49,541
Wakati wa haraka, mara nyingi husahau.

477
00:26:49,565 --> 00:26:53,498
Ndiyo, nitaketi na kuviweka kwenye mfuko.

478
00:26:53,521 --> 00:26:56,460
Umefanya vizuri.

479
00:26:56,483 --> 00:27:01,960
Kama utakusahau kuviweka vijiti, mteja atakuwa na shida.

480
00:27:01,984 --> 00:27:04,759
Ndiyo, ni muhimu sana.

481
00:27:04,782 --> 00:27:09,949
Usisahau kuweka kitambaa cha kunawa mikono pia.

482
00:27:09,972 --> 00:27:13,270
Ndiyo, nitaweka kitambaa cha kunawa mikono pia.

483
00:27:13,293 --> 00:27:15,728
Tayari?

484
00:27:15,752 --> 00:27:18,886
Ndio, niko tayari.

485
00:27:18,909 --> 00:27:22,509
Basi, tuanze mazoezi.

486
00:27:22,532 --> 00:27:26,265
Ndiyo, tafadhali niongoze.

487
00:27:26,288 --> 00:27:27,788
Sehemu ya 13: Kazi ya Kupanga Bidhaa Kwenye Rafu / Misingi ya Kupanga Bidhaa

488
00:27:27,788 --> 00:27:33,438
Ali, sasa nitakufundisha kazi ya kupanga bidhaa kwenye rafu.

489
00:27:33,461 --> 00:27:36,428
Ndio, kupanga bidhaa kwenye rafu.

490
00:27:36,451 --> 00:27:42,460
Bidhaa zinazofika kutoka kwa shantini zitakapangwa kwenye rafu za dukani.

491
00:27:42,483 --> 00:27:45,516
Ndio, nitazipanga.

492
00:27:45,539 --> 00:27:50,273
Tafadhali weka zile zenye tarehe ya mwisho ya kutumia mpya nyuma.

493
00:27:50,296 --> 00:27:54,376
Ndio, zile mpya nyuma.

494
00:27:54,399 --> 00:27:56,604
Ndio.

495
00:27:56,627 --> 00:27:59,604
Tunataka zile za zamani zitiuzwe kwanza.

496
00:27:59,627 --> 00:28:02,296
Ndio, nimeelewa.

497
00:28:02,320 --> 00:28:06,653
Tazama majina ya bidhaa vizuri.

498
00:28:06,676 --> 00:28:09,610
Ndio, nitatazama majina.

499
00:28:09,633 --> 00:28:13,199
Onigiri zipo kwenye rafu ya chini zaidi.

500
00:28:13,222 --> 00:28:16,831
Ndio, rafu ya chini zaidi.

501
00:28:16,855 --> 00:28:19,989
Vinywaji vipo kwenye rafu ya juu.

502
00:28:20,012 --> 00:28:23,012
Ndio, rafu ya juu.

503
00:28:23,035 --> 00:28:27,269
Kama zipo nyingi, pangia nyingi.

504
00:28:27,292 --> 00:28:30,773
Ndio, nitazipanga vizuri.

505
00:28:30,797 --> 00:28:34,664
Zipange kwa njia ambayo wateja wataweza kununua kwa urahisi.

506
00:28:34,687 --> 00:28:37,320
Ndio, nimeelewa.

507
00:28:37,343 --> 00:28:41,110
Tafadhali panga hiyo rafu ya mkate pia.

508
00:28:41,133 --> 00:28:43,466
Ndio, mkate.

509
00:28:43,489 --> 00:28:45,556
Nitakwenda sasa hivi.

510
00:28:45,579 --> 00:28:47,265
Asante sana.

511
00:28:47,288 --> 00:28:50,055
Unafanya kazi haraka sana!

512
00:28:50,078 --> 00:28:52,175
Asante sana.

513
00:28:52,198 --> 00:28:56,365
Kwa sababu ni saa za shughuli, fanya haraka.

514
00:28:56,388 --> 00:28:59,156
Nitazipanga kwa haraka.

515
00:28:59,179 --> 00:29:03,212
Jihadhari usije ukaangusha bidhaa.

516
00:29:03,235 --> 00:29:06,202
Nitazipanga kwa tahadhari.

517
00:29:06,225 --> 00:29:09,358
Kazi ya kupanga bidhaa ni muhimu sana.

518
00:29:09,381 --> 00:29:12,781
Ndio, nitajitahidi kupanga vizuri.

519
00:29:12,804 --> 00:29:14,304
Sehemu ya 14: Kukagua Tarehe ya Mwisho ya Kutumia / Kukagua Tarehe za Kuisha kwa Bidhaa

520
00:29:14,304 --> 00:29:20,072
Ali, tafadhali angalia tarehe ya mwisho ya kutumia kwa chakula cha mchana.

521
00:29:20,096 --> 00:29:23,696
Ndio, tarehe ya mwisho ya kutumia.

522
00:29:23,719 --> 00:29:28,088
Tazama chakula cha mchana kwenye friji hiyo.

523
00:29:28,111 --> 00:29:32,551
Ndio, nitatazama chakula cha mchana.

524
00:29:32,575 --> 00:29:37,775
Kuna chakula cha mchana chenye tarehe ya mwisho ya leo saa kumi?

525
00:29:37,798 --> 00:29:42,806
Ndio, kuna vitatu vyenye saa kumi.

526
00:29:42,829 --> 00:29:47,719
Kwa sababu saa kumi inakaribia, uniondoe.

527
00:29:47,742 --> 00:29:51,557
Ndio, nitaiondoa.

528
00:29:51,580 --> 00:29:55,947
Hauzi chakula cha mchana kilichokwisha muda wake.

529
00:29:55,970 --> 00:30:00,303
Ndio, siwezi kuuza.

530
00:30:00,326 --> 00:30:03,944
Ni dharau, lakini ni sheria.

531
00:30:03,968 --> 00:30:07,535
Ndio, nimeelewa.

532
00:30:07,558 --> 00:30:11,191
Tazama ndani ya friji yote.

533
00:30:11,214 --> 00:30:14,898
Ndio, nitatazama yote.

534
00:30:14,922 --> 00:30:18,289
Tarehe ya mwisho ni kesho?

535
00:30:18,312 --> 00:30:20,172
Leo?

536
00:30:20,195 --> 00:30:24,961
Kuna chakula cha mchana chenye tarehe ya leo.

537
00:30:24,984 --> 00:30:28,657
Vipande hivyo viwe mbele zaidi.

538
00:30:28,681 --> 00:30:32,959
Ndio, nitaviweka mbele.

539
00:30:32,983 --> 00:30:36,864
Tutawahakikishia kwamba wateja wanaweza kununua haraka.

540
00:30:36,888 --> 00:30:40,127
Ndiyo, ni rahisi kununua.

541
00:30:40,151 --> 00:30:44,884
Vitu vyenye tarehe ya mwisho karibu, tafadhali pachika stika.

542
00:30:44,907 --> 00:30:48,307
Ndiyo, nitapachika stika.

543
00:30:48,330 --> 00:30:51,502
Nitapachika stika ya discount.

544
00:30:51,525 --> 00:30:55,492
Ndiyo, stika ya discount.

545
00:30:55,515 --> 00:30:58,115
Umefanya vizuri sana.

546
00:30:58,138 --> 00:31:02,105
Tarehe ya mwisho ya kutumia ni muhimu sana.

547
00:31:02,128 --> 00:31:06,977
Ndiyo, nitacheki kila siku.

548
00:31:07,000 --> 00:31:08,934
Asante sana.

549
00:31:08,957 --> 00:31:11,957
Ndiyo, nitajitahidi.

550
00:31:11,980 --> 00:31:14,467
Tafadhali nisaidie.

551
00:31:14,490 --> 00:31:19,057
Ndiyo, ulinde amana.

552
00:31:19,080 --> 00:31:20,580
Sehemu ya 15: Somo la Kusafisha Duka / Store Cleaning Lesson

553
00:31:20,580 --> 00:31:26,013
Ali, tafadhali safisha sakafu ya duka.

554
00:31:26,036 --> 00:31:29,003
Ndiyo, nitasafisha.

555
00:31:29,026 --> 00:31:32,492
Tumia mopu iliyo huko.

556
00:31:32,515 --> 00:31:35,849
Ndiyo, ile mopu.

557
00:31:35,872 --> 00:31:41,105
Kuna wateja wengi, basi angalia sana.

558
00:31:41,128 --> 00:31:44,695
Ndiyo, nitakuwa makini.

559
00:31:44,718 --> 00:31:48,084
Eneo la mlango limechafuka.

560
00:31:48,107 --> 00:31:52,127
Ndiyo, nitasafisha mlango.

561
00:31:52,150 --> 00:31:58,162
Mlango wa duka ni muhimu sana, basi usafishe vizuri.

562
00:31:58,186 --> 00:32:01,245
Ndiyo, nitasafisha vizuri.

563
00:32:01,268 --> 00:32:05,525
Siku za mvua hasa huchafuka sana.

564
00:32:05,549 --> 00:32:08,549
Ndiyo, mvua.

565
00:32:08,572 --> 00:32:13,106
Leo kuna mvua, kwa hiyo huchafuka haraka.

566
00:32:13,129 --> 00:32:15,218
Ndio.

567
00:32:15,241 --> 00:32:18,041
Safisha mara kadhaa.

568
00:32:18,064 --> 00:32:22,398
Ndiyo, nitasafisha mara kadhaa.

569
00:32:22,420 --> 00:32:26,387
Uwazi wa duka ni muhimu zaidi ya kila kitu.

570
00:32:26,410 --> 00:32:30,043
Ndiyo, ni safi sana.

571
00:32:30,066 --> 00:32:32,670
Ni muhimu.

572
00:32:32,694 --> 00:32:37,227
Tutawahakikishia kwamba wateja wanunua kwa furaha.

573
00:32:37,250 --> 00:32:42,055
Ndiyo, nataka kununua kwa furaha.

574
00:32:42,078 --> 00:32:45,845
Unafahamu jinsi ya kutumia mopu?

575
00:32:45,868 --> 00:32:49,148
Ndiyo, ninafahamu.

576
00:32:49,171 --> 00:32:52,305
Tumia kidogo cha sabuni.

577
00:32:52,328 --> 00:32:56,624
Ndiyo, nitatumia sabuni.

578
00:32:56,648 --> 00:33:01,781
Angalia usije ukasababisha sakafu kusukumika.

579
00:33:01,804 --> 00:33:05,676
Ndiyo, nitakuwa mwangalifu.

580
00:33:05,700 --> 00:33:09,667
Baada ya kusafisha, safisha mopu.

581
00:33:09,690 --> 00:33:13,623
Ndiyo, nitasafisha mopu.

582
00:33:13,646 --> 00:33:15,379
Asante.

583
00:33:15,402 --> 00:33:17,736
Nimekuamini.

584
00:33:17,759 --> 00:33:21,175
Ndiyo, nitasafisha vizuri.

585
00:33:21,199 --> 00:33:23,638
Uwe mzigo wangu.

586
00:33:23,661 --> 00:33:25,161
Sehemu ya 16: Misingi ya Kusafisha Choo / Basics of Toilet Cleaning

587
00:33:25,161 --> 00:33:29,294
Ali, choo kimechafuka.

588
00:33:29,317 --> 00:33:32,287
Ndiyo, nitasafisha mara moja.

589
00:33:32,311 --> 00:33:36,244
Vifaa vya kusafisha choo viko huko.

590
00:33:36,267 --> 00:33:39,234
Ndiyo, vipo huko.

591
00:33:39,256 --> 00:33:41,990
Vaisha gloves.

592
00:33:42,013 --> 00:33:45,346
Ndiyo, nitavaa gloves.

593
00:33:45,369 --> 00:33:50,336
Choo ni mahali ambapo wateja huangalia zaidi.

594
00:33:50,359 --> 00:33:53,959
Ndiyo, ni muhimu sana.

595
00:33:53,982 --> 00:33:58,448
Tumia sabuni kusafisha vizuri.

596
00:33:58,471 --> 00:34:01,871
Ndiyo, nitasafisha vizuri.

597
00:34:01,894 --> 00:34:05,628
Usisahau kufuta sakafu pia.

598
00:34:05,651 --> 00:34:08,547
Ndiyo, nitafuta sakafu pia.

599
00:34:08,570 --> 00:34:11,570
Angalia harufu pia.

600
00:34:11,593 --> 00:34:15,193
Ndiyo, nitatia kioevu cha kunukia.

601
00:34:15,216 --> 00:34:16,906
Asante sana.

602
00:34:16,930 --> 00:34:18,897
Unaonisaidia sana.

603
00:34:18,920 --> 00:34:22,187
Hapana, ni kazi ya muda.

604
00:34:22,210 --> 00:34:25,578
Kufuta choo ni kazi ngumu, eh?

605
00:34:25,601 --> 00:34:30,176
Ndiyo, lakini inakuwa hisia nzuri wakati inakuwa safi.

606
00:34:30,200 --> 00:34:32,038
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

607
00:34:32,061 --> 00:34:35,400
Tujitahidi kwa ajili ya wateja.

608
00:34:35,424 --> 00:34:38,591
Ndiyo, nitajitahidi.

609
00:34:38,614 --> 00:34:41,580
Uaniambie baada ya kumaliza.

610
00:34:41,603 --> 00:34:45,137
Ndiyo, nitaarifu baada ya kumaliza.

611
00:34:45,160 --> 00:34:48,410
Usisahau kunawa mikono vizuri.

612
00:34:48,434 --> 00:34:51,450
Ndiyo, nitanawa vizuri.

613
00:34:51,473 --> 00:34:53,506
Asante sana.

614
00:34:53,529 --> 00:34:56,734
Ndiyo, nitamaliza haraka.

615
00:34:56,758 --> 00:34:59,053
Tafadhali nisaidie.

616
00:34:59,076 --> 00:35:02,544
Ndiyo, nitafuta ili nisafishe vizuri.

617
00:35:02,568 --> 00:35:04,068
Mstari 17: Ukaguzi na Kuongeza Hisa / Checking and Restocking Inventory

618
00:35:04,068 --> 00:35:08,684
Ali, hakuna bidhaa kwenye rafu.

619
00:35:08,708 --> 00:35:11,179
Ndiyo, imekwisha.

620
00:35:11,202 --> 00:35:15,571
Labda iko mahali pengine, tafuta.

621
00:35:15,595 --> 00:35:18,169
Ndiyo, nitatafuta.

622
00:35:18,193 --> 00:35:21,206
Umetafuta nyuma ya duka?

623
00:35:21,229 --> 00:35:23,862
Hapana, sijatafuta bado.

624
00:35:23,885 --> 00:35:26,085
Nitatafuta sasa.

625
00:35:26,108 --> 00:35:28,075
Asante sana.

626
00:35:28,098 --> 00:35:30,754
Zimeuzwa sana, eh?

627
00:35:30,778 --> 00:35:34,660
Ndiyo, tuna shughuli nyingi sana.

628
00:35:34,683 --> 00:35:38,216
Kama kuna hisa, weka haraka kwenye rafu.

629
00:35:38,239 --> 00:35:41,322
Ndiyo, nitaweka haraka.

630
00:35:41,346 --> 00:35:45,603
Kama hakuna hisa, niambie.

631
00:35:45,627 --> 00:35:49,794
Ndiyo, kama hakuna hisa nitaarifu.

632
00:35:49,817 --> 00:35:51,250
Tafadhali.

633
00:35:51,273 --> 00:35:55,326
Bidhaa hii ni maarufu sana.

634
00:35:55,349 --> 00:35:58,442
Ndiyo, napenda pia.

635
00:35:58,466 --> 00:36:01,633
Wateja wanaweza wakatafuta.

636
00:36:01,656 --> 00:36:05,733
Ndiyo, wanaweza wakaja kutafuta.

637
00:36:05,757 --> 00:36:08,242
Tungewahi kuipata haraka.

638
00:36:08,265 --> 00:36:11,798
Ndiyo, nitajitahidi kutafuta.

639
00:36:11,821 --> 00:36:16,459
Nyuma ya duka imesafishwa vizuri, hivyo ni rahisi kuona.

640
00:36:16,482 --> 00:36:19,682
Ndiyo, ni rahisi kuona.

641
00:36:19,705 --> 00:36:21,581
Asante sana.

642
00:36:21,604 --> 00:36:25,004
Ndiyo, nitarudi haraka.

643
00:36:25,027 --> 00:36:27,194
Nakuombea kazi njema.

644
00:36:27,217 --> 00:36:29,684
Ndiyo, ninaenda sasa.

645
00:36:29,707 --> 00:36:32,273
Nitatafuta haraka.

646
00:36:32,296 --> 00:36:33,796
Mstari 18: Mshahara wa Kwanza / First Paycheck

647
00:36:33,796 --> 00:36:38,132
Ali, leo ni siku ya mshahara, eh?

648
00:36:38,156 --> 00:36:41,489
Ndiyo, ni siku ya mshahara.

649
00:36:41,512 --> 00:36:44,312
Ninangojea sana.

650
00:36:44,335 --> 00:36:47,585
Umeangalia akaunti yako?

651
00:36:47,609 --> 00:36:50,942
Ndiyo, nimeangalia.

652
00:36:50,965 --> 00:36:53,532
Fedha zimeingia.

653
00:36:53,555 --> 00:36:56,088
Vizuri sana, hiyo!

654
00:36:56,111 --> 00:36:59,445
Hii ni pesa kwa juhudi zako.

655
00:36:59,468 --> 00:37:03,104
Ndiyo. Ninafurahi sana.

656
00:37:03,128 --> 00:37:07,378
Utatumia mshahara wako wa kwanza kwa nini?

657
00:37:07,402 --> 00:37:11,402
Nitawاشiria wazazi wangu zawadi.

658
00:37:11,425 --> 00:37:14,558
Nitawatuma familia yangu nchini Malaysia.

659
00:37:14,581 --> 00:37:17,314
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

660
00:37:17,337 --> 00:37:20,704
Familia yako itafurahi sana.

661
00:37:20,727 --> 00:37:24,093
Ndiyo. Nitafurahi sana.

662
00:37:24,116 --> 00:37:28,370
Je, hutaji kununua chochote kwa ajili yako mwenyewe?

663
00:37:28,394 --> 00:37:30,194
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

664
00:37:30,217 --> 00:37:34,183
Natamani nguo mpya za Kijapani.

665
00:37:34,206 --> 00:37:36,240
Nguo?

666
00:37:36,263 --> 00:37:38,349
Nzuri sana!

667
00:37:38,373 --> 00:37:42,252
Ndiyo. Nitaenda kununua wikendi hii.

668
00:37:42,276 --> 00:37:45,476
Hii ni zawadi kwa juhudi zako.

669
00:37:45,499 --> 00:37:48,432
Ndiyo. Ni zawadi.

670
00:37:48,455 --> 00:37:51,954
Tukajitahidi kwa kazi inayofuata pia.

671
00:37:51,978 --> 00:37:56,111
Ndiyo. Nitajitahidi kwa kazi inayofuata.

672
00:37:56,134 --> 00:38:00,068
Ali, sasa wewe ni mstari wa mbele katika duka hili.

673
00:38:00,090 --> 00:38:02,327
Ndiyo. Asante sana.

674
00:38:02,350 --> 00:38:05,566
Tunategemea uendelee kusaidia.

675
00:38:05,589 --> 00:38:09,806
Ndiyo. Nitendelea kusaidia.

676
00:38:09,830 --> 00:38:13,796
Mshahara huu unanifurahisha sana kweli.

677
00:38:13,819 --> 00:38:15,319
Sehemu ya 19: Kukabiliana na Makosa ya Pesa ya Mrejesho / Kutatua Makosa ya Mrejesho wa Pesa

678
00:38:15,319 --> 00:38:18,353
Ali, samahani.

679
00:38:18,375 --> 00:38:22,056
Nimekosea katika pesa ya mrejesho.

680
00:38:22,080 --> 00:38:25,214
Ndiyo. Kuna nini?

681
00:38:25,237 --> 00:38:30,403
Nimewapa mteja shilingi mia moja zaidi.

682
00:38:30,426 --> 00:38:33,305
Hiyo ni tatizo kubwa.

683
00:38:33,329 --> 00:38:36,804
Je, pesa katika kaseti ziko sawa?

684
00:38:36,827 --> 00:38:40,594
Hapana, zinatosha shilingi mia moja.

685
00:38:40,617 --> 00:38:43,850
Nitawasilisha taarifa kwa meneja.

686
00:38:43,873 --> 00:38:47,540
Samahani. Asante sana.

687
00:38:47,563 --> 00:38:50,622
Je, mteja yupo bado?

688
00:38:50,645 --> 00:38:54,462
Hapana, ameondoka tayari.

689
00:38:54,486 --> 00:38:56,552
Ni bahati mbaya.

690
00:38:56,575 --> 00:39:00,545
Lakini kila mtu anaweza kukosea.

691
00:39:00,569 --> 00:39:03,585
Sawa. Nitahifadhi vizuri.

692
00:39:03,609 --> 00:39:06,942
Mimi pia nilikosea mara kwa mara hapo awali.

693
00:39:06,965 --> 00:39:08,774
Kweli?

694
00:39:08,798 --> 00:39:11,216
Nimefarijika.

695
00:39:11,239 --> 00:39:15,173
Tutazingatia polepole kesho kutoka sasa.

696
00:39:15,196 --> 00:39:18,612
Ndiyo. Nitazingatia polepole.

697
00:39:18,635 --> 00:39:22,401
Tutazame tena kiasi cha pesa katika kaseti.

698
00:39:22,424 --> 00:39:25,430
Ndiyo. Tutazame pamoja.

699
00:39:25,454 --> 00:39:29,454
Ni muhimu kurekebisha makosa haraka.

700
00:39:29,476 --> 00:39:32,410
Ndiyo. Nitakarabati haraka.

701
00:39:32,433 --> 00:39:34,599
Usijali.

702
00:39:34,622 --> 00:39:36,189
Asante sana.

703
00:39:36,212 --> 00:39:39,845
Ndiyo. Tutazingatia zaidi kesho.

704
00:39:39,868 --> 00:39:41,802
Ndiyo. Asante sana.

705
00:39:41,825 --> 00:39:44,491
Tujitahidi tena.

706
00:39:44,514 --> 00:39:46,014
Sehemu ya 20: Hadithi ya Kujikosa na Mwako wa Umeme / Somo Kuhusu Makosa ya Mwako wa Umeme

707
00:39:46,014 --> 00:39:52,449
Ali, nilijaribu kupasha moto chakula cha mchana kwa mwako wa umeme, lakini nilikosea.

708
00:39:52,473 --> 00:39:56,040
Ndiyo. Kuna nini?

709
00:39:56,063 --> 00:40:01,430
Nimechokoa kwa muda mrefu sana, na chombo kimeyeyuka.

710
00:40:01,453 --> 00:40:04,546
Eeh, hiyo ni mbaya sana.

711
00:40:04,569 --> 00:40:08,261
Je, mteja alikasirika?

712
00:40:08,284 --> 00:40:13,919
Hapana, hakukasirika, lakini naomba msamaha.

713
00:40:13,943 --> 00:40:18,201
Mimi nitabadilisha na chakula kipya.

714
00:40:18,224 --> 00:40:19,918
Asante sana.

715
00:40:19,942 --> 00:40:22,013
Samahani.

716
00:40:22,036 --> 00:40:25,803
Je, muda wa microwave ni sawa?

717
00:40:25,827 --> 00:40:29,960
Ndiyo. Kuna muda uliandikwa kwenye begi.

718
00:40:29,983 --> 00:40:33,150
Kutoka sasa nitazingatia zaidi.

719
00:40:33,173 --> 00:40:36,251
Ndiyo. Tafadhali angalia vizuri.

720
00:40:36,275 --> 00:40:40,133
Microwave inakuwa moto sana.

721
00:40:40,156 --> 00:40:43,756
Ndiyo. Inakuwa moto sana.

722
00:40:43,779 --> 00:40:46,579
Jihadharini na kuchomwa moto.

723
00:40:46,602 --> 00:40:50,369
Ndiyo. Nitahusu kwa tahadhari.

724
00:40:50,392 --> 00:40:53,480
Je, chakula kiko sawa?

725
00:40:53,503 --> 00:40:57,636
Ndiyo. Kuna chakula kipya.

726
00:40:57,659 --> 00:40:59,718
Vizuri sana.

727
00:40:59,742 --> 00:41:02,875
Tuombe msamaha kwa mteja.

728
00:41:02,898 --> 00:41:05,665
Ndiyo. Nitaomba msamaha.

729
00:41:05,688 --> 00:41:09,254
Je, mteja alikuwa mtu mpole?

730
00:41:09,277 --> 00:41:12,644
Ndiyo. Alikuwa mtu mpole.

731
00:41:12,667 --> 00:41:15,500
Hiyo ni raha.

732
00:41:15,523 --> 00:41:18,591
Ndiyo. Nimefurahi.

733
00:41:18,615 --> 00:41:21,418
Kutoka sasa sitashindwa tena.

734
00:41:21,441 --> 00:41:24,724
Ndiyo. Tuwe na bidii.

735
00:41:24,747 --> 00:41:27,680
Tutathmini pamoja.

736
00:41:27,703 --> 00:41:30,639
Ndiyo. Asante sana.

737
00:41:30,663 --> 00:41:32,163
Mstari wa 21: Mazoezi ya Kuhudumia Wateja

738
00:41:32,163 --> 00:41:37,844
Ali, mteja yule anatafuta kinywaji baridi.

739
00:41:37,868 --> 00:41:42,083
Ndiyo. Apenda aina gani ya kinywaji?

740
00:41:42,106 --> 00:41:46,440
Uliza kama anapenda chai au juisi.

741
00:41:46,463 --> 00:41:49,359
Ndiyo. Nitauliza.

742
00:41:49,382 --> 00:41:53,230
Mteja, unapenda chai?

743
00:41:53,254 --> 00:41:56,388
Au unapenda juisi?

744
00:41:56,411 --> 00:42:00,744
Mteja anasema anataka chai ya kijani.

745
00:42:00,767 --> 00:42:02,740
Sawa, nimeelewa.

746
00:42:02,763 --> 00:42:06,302
Chai baridi ya kijani iko huko.

747
00:42:06,325 --> 00:42:09,801
Mwongoze pamoja naye.

748
00:42:09,825 --> 00:42:12,758
Ndiyo. Tafadhali njoo hapa.

749
00:42:12,781 --> 00:42:16,026
Chai hii ya kijani ni maarufu sana.

750
00:42:16,050 --> 00:42:19,301
Umewafahamisha vizuri.

751
00:42:19,324 --> 00:42:21,257
Asante sana.

752
00:42:21,280 --> 00:42:24,914
Mteja alifurahi.

753
00:42:24,937 --> 00:42:27,748
Hiyo ni nzuri.

754
00:42:27,771 --> 00:42:32,738
Sasa mwonyeke mahali pa vinywaji vinavyofanya povu.

755
00:42:32,761 --> 00:42:37,604
Ndiyo. Vinywaji vinavyofanya povu ni maarufu pia.

756
00:42:37,628 --> 00:42:42,637
Ndiyo. Kola na soda ziko kwenye rafu hiyo.

757
00:42:42,660 --> 00:42:45,994
Ndiyo. Hiyo ndiyo rafu.

758
00:42:46,017 --> 00:42:49,704
Kola iko kwenye safu ya chini zaidi.

759
00:42:49,727 --> 00:42:52,337
Unajua vizuri.

760
00:42:52,361 --> 00:42:56,937
Ndiyo. Kila siku naweka bidhaa kwenye rafu.

761
00:42:56,960 --> 00:42:59,227
Hiyo ni nzuri sana.

762
00:42:59,251 --> 00:43:01,146
Asante sana.

763
00:43:01,169 --> 00:43:04,936
Tafadhali fanya rafu ya chai iwe safi pia.

764
00:43:04,959 --> 00:43:08,193
Ndiyo. Nitaipanga vizuri.

765
00:43:08,216 --> 00:43:11,390
Ali anafanya kazi kwa bidii sana, sivyo?

766
00:43:11,413 --> 00:43:15,429
Ndiyo. Napenda duka hili.

767
00:43:15,453 --> 00:43:16,953
Mstari wa 22: Kusaidia Kutafuta Mkoba Uliopotea

768
00:43:16,953 --> 00:43:20,219
Mteja, umeshindwa na nini?

769
00:43:20,242 --> 00:43:21,809
Samahani.

770
00:43:21,832 --> 00:43:24,865
Nimepoteza mkoba wangu.

771
00:43:24,888 --> 00:43:27,688
Ulichokuwa ununua hapa?

772
00:43:27,711 --> 00:43:30,603
Hapana, sijatafuta bado.

773
00:43:30,627 --> 00:43:34,193
Labda nilipoteza kabla ya kuingia dukani.

774
00:43:34,216 --> 00:43:36,883
Ulienda wapi?

775
00:43:36,907 --> 00:43:40,140
Nilikwenda njiani mbele ya duka hili.

776
00:43:40,163 --> 00:43:42,530
Tutafute pamoja.

777
00:43:42,553 --> 00:43:44,130
Asante sana.

778
00:43:44,153 --> 00:43:47,153
Karibu na miti ya bustani, umeangalia?

779
00:43:47,176 --> 00:43:50,254
Nimeangalia, lakini hakupatikani.

780
00:43:50,278 --> 00:43:52,944
Kwenye pembe ile, umeangalia?

781
00:43:52,967 --> 00:43:56,901
Aa, kuna kitu pale.

782
00:43:56,924 --> 00:43:59,169
Je, ni mkoba?

783
00:43:59,193 --> 00:44:02,832
Ndiyo, ni mkoba wangu.

784
00:44:02,855 --> 00:44:05,022
Vizuri sana.

785
00:44:05,045 --> 00:44:07,611
Sawa kabisa, asante Mungu.

786
00:44:07,634 --> 00:44:10,111
Kitu chochote kilichokuwa ndani kiko salama?

787
00:44:10,135 --> 00:44:13,581
Ndiyo, kila kitu kiko ndani.

788
00:44:13,605 --> 00:44:15,495
Nimefarijika.

789
00:44:15,518 --> 00:44:18,284
Asante sana kwa ukaribu wako.

790
00:44:18,307 --> 00:44:20,759
Duka hili ni la wema sana.

791
00:44:20,783 --> 00:44:23,616
Hapana, tunafurahi kukusaidia.

792
00:44:23,639 --> 00:44:26,672
Endelea na tahadhari nyumbani.

793
00:44:26,695 --> 00:44:29,552
Ndiyo. Asante sana.

794
00:44:29,576 --> 00:44:32,509
Je, utanunua kitu?

795
00:44:32,532 --> 00:44:35,627
Ndiyo, nitanunua maji.

796
00:44:35,651 --> 00:44:37,785
Sawa, karibu.

797
00:44:37,808 --> 00:44:39,308
Mstari wa 23: Kufundisha Mfanyakazi Mpya

798
00:44:39,308 --> 00:44:43,908
Ali, leo tutakuwa na mfanyakazi mpya.

799
00:44:43,931 --> 00:44:45,208
Ndiyo.

800
00:44:45,232 --> 00:44:47,168
Je, ni mwanaume?

801
00:44:47,192 --> 00:44:48,858
Je, ni mwanamke?

802
00:44:48,881 --> 00:44:51,815
Ni mwanafunzi wa chuo kikuu wa Kijapani.

803
00:44:51,838 --> 00:44:55,438
Tafadhali, wewe ufundishe Ali kazi.

804
00:44:55,461 --> 00:44:57,061
Ndiyo.

805
00:44:57,084 --> 00:44:59,650
Nitafundisha.

806
00:44:59,673 --> 00:45:04,317
Kwa kuwa ni mara yake ya kwanza, mfundishe kwa upole.

807
00:45:04,341 --> 00:45:05,979
Ndiyo.

808
00:45:06,002 --> 00:45:08,569
Nitafundisha kwa upole.

809
00:45:08,592 --> 00:45:09,880
Hujambo.

810
00:45:09,904 --> 00:45:12,270
Jina langu ni Ali.

811
00:45:12,293 --> 00:45:14,983
Yeye ni Ken.

812
00:45:15,007 --> 00:45:20,423
Ken, jifunze kutumia kasha la fedha kutoka kwa Ali.

813
00:45:20,446 --> 00:45:22,688
Hujambo, Ken.

814
00:45:22,711 --> 00:45:26,511
Kutumia kasha la fedha si vigumu.

815
00:45:26,534 --> 00:45:29,067
Tafadhali, Ali.

816
00:45:29,090 --> 00:45:30,929
Ndiyo.

817
00:45:30,953 --> 00:45:33,192
Kwanza, bonyeza hapa.

818
00:45:33,215 --> 00:45:36,282
Ken, umeelewa?

819
00:45:36,305 --> 00:45:39,338
Ken, angalia hapa.

820
00:45:39,361 --> 00:45:42,361
Barcode inasomwa hapa.

821
00:45:42,384 --> 00:45:46,237
Ali anaeleza vizuri sana.

822
00:45:46,261 --> 00:45:47,961
Asante sana.

823
00:45:47,984 --> 00:45:50,865
Utazoea polepole.

824
00:45:50,889 --> 00:45:54,302
Ken, jitahidi.

825
00:45:54,325 --> 00:45:55,665
Ndiyo.

826
00:45:55,689 --> 00:45:58,135
Tutajitahidi pamoja.

827
00:45:58,158 --> 00:46:01,825
Kama kuna tatizo lolote, nitaeni mimi.

828
00:46:01,848 --> 00:46:03,581
Ndiyo.

829
00:46:03,604 --> 00:46:05,683
Ninaweza kukupigia simu.

830
00:46:05,706 --> 00:46:09,040
Ndugu Ali, sasa wewe ni mwandamizi wetu.

831
00:46:09,062 --> 00:46:10,829
Ndiyo.

832
00:46:10,852 --> 00:46:13,485
Kama mwandamizi, nitajitahidi kwa bidii.

833
00:46:13,508 --> 00:46:15,008
Mchezo wa 24: Huduma kwa Wateja Siku ya Mvua / Huduma kwa Wateja Siku ya Mvua

834
00:46:15,008 --> 00:46:19,242
Ndugu Ali, mvua imetokea.

835
00:46:19,265 --> 00:46:23,708
Ndiyo. Nje kuna mvua nyingi sana.

836
00:46:23,731 --> 00:46:27,098
Tuna huduma maalum kwa siku za mvua.

837
00:46:27,121 --> 00:46:30,921
Ndiyo. Ni huduma gani hasa?

838
00:46:30,944 --> 00:46:35,477
Tafadhali weka miwani ya plastiki karibu na ingresso.

839
00:46:35,500 --> 00:46:39,870
Sawa. Nitaweka miwani ya plastiki.

840
00:46:39,894 --> 00:46:45,060
Siku za mvua, wateja huja na miwani yao.

841
00:46:45,083 --> 00:46:49,138
Ndiyo. Tutahitaji mifuko ya miwani.

842
00:46:49,162 --> 00:46:51,563
Ndio.

843
00:46:51,586 --> 00:46:54,881
Tafadhali weka mifuko ya miwani karibu na ingresso.

844
00:46:54,905 --> 00:46:57,483
Sawa. Nimeiweka tayari.

845
00:46:57,506 --> 00:47:00,563
Tunataka wateja wasikose kupata majimaji.

846
00:47:00,586 --> 00:47:02,645
Asante sana.

847
00:47:02,669 --> 00:47:07,235
Pia, ingresso huwa inayofifia kwa urahisi.

848
00:47:07,258 --> 00:47:10,991
Ndiyo. Nitasafisha sakafu.

849
00:47:11,014 --> 00:47:14,508
Tafadhali angalia usikose kufifia.

850
00:47:14,532 --> 00:47:17,499
Ndiyo. Nitakuwa makini.

851
00:47:17,522 --> 00:47:22,089
Siku za mvua, wateja wanaweza kuwa wachache.

852
00:47:22,112 --> 00:47:27,005
Ndiyo. Lakini nitajaza mikate tena.

853
00:47:27,028 --> 00:47:28,995
Vizuri sana.

854
00:47:29,018 --> 00:47:33,426
Siku za mvua, vinywaji vya moto huuzwa sana.

855
00:47:33,450 --> 00:47:36,934
Ndiyo. Nitatayarisha vingi.

856
00:47:36,958 --> 00:47:40,958
Ndugu Ali, una macho mazuri sana.

857
00:47:40,981 --> 00:47:43,865
Ndiyo. Ninafurahi sana.

858
00:47:43,888 --> 00:47:46,422
Tungependa mvua isingeacha.

859
00:47:46,445 --> 00:47:49,855
Ndiyo. Ingependeza isingeacha.

860
00:47:49,878 --> 00:47:51,645
Tujitahidi kwa bidii.

861
00:47:51,668 --> 00:47:54,744
Ndiyo. Nitajitahidi.

862
00:47:54,768 --> 00:47:56,268
Mchezo wa 25: Misingi ya Kufanya Kazi ya Kasherere / Misingi ya Kazi ya Kasherere

863
00:47:56,268 --> 00:48:00,601
Ndugu Ali, leo tuna shughuli nyingi sana.

864
00:48:00,624 --> 00:48:06,643
Ndiyo. Ni wakati wa chakula cha mchana, hivyo wateja wengi wako hapa.

865
00:48:06,666 --> 00:48:10,684
Wateja wengi wanunua chakula cha mchana.

866
00:48:10,708 --> 00:48:15,241
Ndiyo. Ninahudumia mteja mmoja baada ya mwingine.

867
00:48:15,264 --> 00:48:19,161
Usikose, fanya kazi kwa utulivu na uangalifu.

868
00:48:19,185 --> 00:48:22,643
Ndiyo. Nitafanya kazi kwa uangalifu.

869
00:48:22,666 --> 00:48:26,099
Tafadhali hakikisha pesa ya mteja inarudishwa vizuri.

870
00:48:26,122 --> 00:48:29,797
Ndiyo. Nitahakikisha pesa ya mteja inarudishwa vizuri.

871
00:48:29,821 --> 00:48:33,255
Je, unataka nikainue joto?

872
00:48:33,278 --> 00:48:35,495
ndio nitakaposema.

873
00:48:35,518 --> 00:48:38,285
Ndiyo. Je, nikainue joto?

874
00:48:38,308 --> 00:48:39,980
ndio nitakaposema.

875
00:48:40,003 --> 00:48:43,006
Usikose kuweka vijiko.

876
00:48:43,029 --> 00:48:46,563
Ndiyo. Nitaweka vijiko.

877
00:48:46,586 --> 00:48:49,352
Endelea na kazi ya kasherere.

878
00:48:49,375 --> 00:48:52,226
Ndiyo. Nitajitahidi.

879
00:48:52,250 --> 00:48:55,746
Usisahau kusema, 'Umesubiriwa'.

880
00:48:55,770 --> 00:48:57,904
Umesubiriwa.

881
00:48:57,927 --> 00:49:00,660
Sauti yako ni nzuri sana.

882
00:49:00,683 --> 00:49:02,320
Asante sana.

883
00:49:02,344 --> 00:49:06,918
Kuna muda mfupi tu uliosalia wa shughuli nyingi.

884
00:49:06,941 --> 00:49:10,075
Ndiyo. Nitajitahidi.

885
00:49:10,098 --> 00:49:15,264
Wakati wa shughuli nyingi, ushirikiano na wenzako ndio jambo bora zaidi.

886
00:49:15,287 --> 00:49:18,121
Ndiyo. Nitafanya kazi kwa ushirikiano.

887
00:49:18,144 --> 00:49:20,311
Umechoka?

888
00:49:20,334 --> 00:49:23,378
Hapana, ni sawa.

889
00:49:23,402 --> 00:49:26,048
Tukisha, tuachilie kidogo.

890
00:49:26,071 --> 00:49:29,139
Ndiyo. Tutachoka.

891
00:49:29,162 --> 00:49:30,662
Sehemu ya 26: Mazoezi ya Kuonyesha Njiapanda / Mazoezi ya Mwongozo kwa Kijapani

892
00:49:30,662 --> 00:49:34,662
Mteja anamuuliza, "Stesheni iko wapi?"

893
00:49:34,685 --> 00:49:36,923
Anamuuliza.

894
00:49:36,946 --> 00:49:40,199
Ndiyo. Stesheni, ndiyo.

895
00:49:40,223 --> 00:49:44,189
Pinda kulia kwenye kona hii.

896
00:49:44,212 --> 00:49:48,419
Baada ya hapo, kuna njia?

897
00:49:48,443 --> 00:49:53,179
Baada ya hapo, endelea moja kwa moja.

898
00:49:53,203 --> 00:49:55,483
Ni mbali?

899
00:49:55,506 --> 00:49:59,174
Hapana, ni dakika tano hivi.

900
00:49:59,198 --> 00:50:02,631
Anasema, "Asante sana."

901
00:50:02,654 --> 00:50:06,988
Hapana, starehe.

902
00:50:07,011 --> 00:50:11,144
Ali, unaongoza njia vizuri sana!

903
00:50:11,167 --> 00:50:15,384
Ndiyo. Nilitazama ramani.

904
00:50:15,408 --> 00:50:19,057
Mteja alifurahi sana.

905
00:50:19,080 --> 00:50:22,413
Ndiyo. Nimefurahi.

906
00:50:22,436 --> 00:50:26,408
Kuongoza kwa Kijapani ni vigumu, sivyo?

907
00:50:26,432 --> 00:50:32,515
Ndiyo. Ni vigumu kidogo, lakini ninafurahi.

908
00:50:32,538 --> 00:50:35,272
Uliwasaidia sana.

909
00:50:35,295 --> 00:50:38,828
Ndiyo. Niliwasaidia.

910
00:50:38,851 --> 00:50:44,097
Kuna vivutio vingine karibu na hapa?

911
00:50:44,120 --> 00:50:49,320
Ndiyo. Kuna bustani kubwa pale.

912
00:50:49,343 --> 00:50:53,576
Ndiyo hiyo, ni nzuri kwa kutembea.

913
00:50:53,599 --> 00:50:56,877
Ndiyo. Ni nzuri sana.

914
00:50:56,900 --> 00:51:01,542
Kwa sababu ya Ali, mteja alipata amani.

915
00:51:01,566 --> 00:51:04,541
Ndiyo. Nimefurahi.

916
00:51:04,564 --> 00:51:07,697
Tutakutegemea tena siku zijazo.

917
00:51:07,720 --> 00:51:10,854
Ndiyo. Nitajitahidi.

918
00:51:10,877 --> 00:51:12,377
Sehemu ya 27: Mazungumzo Wakati wa Mapumziko / Mazungumzo Wakati wa Kupumzika

919
00:51:12,377 --> 00:51:16,636
Ali, ni wakati wa kupumzika.

920
00:51:16,659 --> 00:51:19,459
Ndiyo, asante.

921
00:51:19,482 --> 00:51:21,915
Utakula nini?

922
00:51:21,938 --> 00:51:25,705
Mimi nitakula onigiri.

923
00:51:25,728 --> 00:51:29,494
Mimi nitakula sandwichi.

924
00:51:29,517 --> 00:51:33,451
Wakati wa mapumziko unafanya nini?

925
00:51:33,474 --> 00:51:37,607
Mimi kwa kawaida nasikiliza muziki.

926
00:51:37,630 --> 00:51:40,397
Muziki wa Kijapani?

927
00:51:40,420 --> 00:51:45,020
Ndiyo, siku hizi napenda pop ya Kijapani.

928
00:51:45,043 --> 00:51:47,921
Unapenda muziki wa nani?

929
00:51:47,945 --> 00:51:52,145
Napenda YOASOBI.

930
00:51:52,168 --> 00:51:54,343
Mimi pia napenda.

931
00:51:54,366 --> 00:51:57,299
Ni maarufu sana, sivyo?

932
00:51:57,322 --> 00:52:01,189
Ndiyo, maneno ya nyimbo yao ni ya kuvutia sana.

933
00:52:01,212 --> 00:52:04,745
Je, unasikiliza muziki wa Malaysia pia?

934
00:52:04,768 --> 00:52:09,337
Ndiyo, nyimbo za Malaysia pia ni nzuri sana.

935
00:52:09,361 --> 00:52:11,761
Siku nyingine unionyeshe.

936
00:52:11,784 --> 00:52:15,384
Ndiyo, usikilize bila shaka.

937
00:52:15,407 --> 00:52:20,440
Wakati wa mapumziko ni mfupi, lakini ni muhimu.

938
00:52:20,463 --> 00:52:23,796
Ndiyo, tunaweza kujiburudisha.

939
00:52:23,819 --> 00:52:27,264
Tufanye kazi kwa bidii mchana huu.

940
00:52:27,288 --> 00:52:30,098
Ndiyo, nitajitahidi.

941
00:52:30,122 --> 00:52:34,539
Tukisha kupumzika, nitakuchukua nafasi yako kwenye kasha.

942
00:52:34,562 --> 00:52:36,563
Ndiyo, tafadhali niongoze.

943
00:52:36,586 --> 00:52:39,237
Nimechangamka.

944
00:52:39,261 --> 00:52:40,761
Mstari wa 28: Kuandaa Kufunga / Maandalizi ya Muda wa Kufunga

945
00:52:40,761 --> 00:52:45,213
Ali, muda wa kwenda nyumbani umekaribia.

946
00:52:45,237 --> 00:52:48,525
Ndiyo. Saa tatu zimefika.

947
00:52:48,548 --> 00:52:51,044
Asante kwa leo.

948
00:52:51,067 --> 00:52:54,242
Ndiyo. Umechoka sana.

949
00:52:54,265 --> 00:52:57,532
Tuchambue pesa za kwenye kasregister.

950
00:52:57,555 --> 00:53:00,788
Ndiyo. Hebu tuhesabu.

951
00:53:00,811 --> 00:53:03,544
Pesa ziko sawa?

952
00:53:03,567 --> 00:53:06,457
Ndiyo. Ziko kamili.

953
00:53:06,481 --> 00:53:08,548
Vizuri sana.

954
00:53:08,571 --> 00:53:11,772
Utawala wa nyuma pia umekwisha vizuri.

955
00:53:11,795 --> 00:53:15,363
Ndiyo. Usafi pia umekamilika.

956
00:53:15,387 --> 00:53:18,605
Tumetupa takataka?

957
00:53:18,629 --> 00:53:21,232
Ndiyo. Nimetupa.

958
00:53:21,255 --> 00:53:22,937
Asante sana.

959
00:53:22,961 --> 00:53:26,094
Unaweza kutegemewa.

960
00:53:26,117 --> 00:53:29,129
Hapana, ni jambo la kawaida.

961
00:53:29,153 --> 00:53:31,772
Tutaonana kesho kutwa, sivyo?

962
00:53:31,796 --> 00:53:35,164
Ndiyo. Kesho kutwa.

963
00:53:35,187 --> 00:53:38,020
Tutakuwa na furaha kukutana tena.

964
00:53:38,043 --> 00:53:41,294
Ndiyo. Tunangojea.

965
00:53:41,318 --> 00:53:44,085
Nitakuwa na ruhusa ya kuondoka mapema.

966
00:53:44,108 --> 00:53:46,475
Umechoka sana.

967
00:53:46,498 --> 00:53:48,866
Umechoka sana.

968
00:53:48,889 --> 00:53:51,456
Rudi nyumbani salama.

969
00:53:51,479 --> 00:53:55,358
Ndiyo. Nitakuwa na tahadhari.

970
00:53:55,381 --> 00:53:57,874
Nitakuja tena kesho kutwa.

971
00:53:57,898 --> 00:54:00,931
Ndiyo. Tutaonana kesho kutwa.

972
00:54:00,954 --> 00:54:02,887
Samahani.

973
00:54:02,910 --> 00:54:04,410
Mstari wa 29: Ukuaji wa Ali / Ukuaji na Maendeleo ya Ali

974
00:54:04,410 --> 00:54:09,544
Ali, siku hizi umekuwa mzuri sana.

975
00:54:09,567 --> 00:54:11,900
Ndiyo, asante.

976
00:54:11,923 --> 00:54:15,723
Mwanzo ulikuwa ukijikaza sana, sivyo?

977
00:54:15,746 --> 00:54:19,479
Ndiyo, nilijikaza sana kweli.

978
00:54:19,502 --> 00:54:22,836
Sasa unaonekana kama kiongozi.

979
00:54:22,859 --> 00:54:26,792
Ndiyo, kazi imekuwa ya furaha.

980
00:54:26,815 --> 00:54:30,433
Unaongea sana na wateja pia.

981
00:54:30,456 --> 00:54:34,509
Ndiyo, nina wateja wa kawaida sasa.

982
00:54:34,533 --> 00:54:36,984
Hii ni nzuri sana.

983
00:54:37,007 --> 00:54:40,341
Kiswahili chako pia kimekuwa cha kawaida sana.

984
00:54:40,364 --> 00:54:42,179
Asante sana.

985
00:54:42,202 --> 00:54:44,484
Ni kwa sababu ya meneja.

986
00:54:44,507 --> 00:54:48,323
Hapana, ni kwa sababu ya jitihada zako.

987
00:54:48,347 --> 00:54:50,757
Ninashukuru sana.

988
00:54:50,780 --> 00:54:53,647
Tuendelee na bidii hii.

989
00:54:53,670 --> 00:54:56,805
Ndiyo, nitajitahidi zaidi.

990
00:54:56,828 --> 00:55:00,028
Una tatizo lolote?

991
00:55:00,051 --> 00:55:03,668
Hapana, kwa sasa hakuna.

992
00:55:03,692 --> 00:55:06,825
Enda ukijihisi na tatizo, wasiliana nami.

993
00:55:06,848 --> 00:55:09,648
Ndiyo, nitakuambia.

994
00:55:09,671 --> 00:55:13,004
Natumaini ukuaji wako.

995
00:55:13,027 --> 00:55:16,394
Ndiyo, natumaini pia.

996
00:55:16,417 --> 00:55:18,150
Asante.

997
00:55:18,173 --> 00:55:22,269
Ndiyo, asante pia.

998
00:55:22,293 --> 00:55:23,793
Mstari wa 30: Amani ya Kuaga / Shukrani ya Kuaga

999
00:55:23,793 --> 00:55:27,593
Ali, leo ni siku yako ya mwisho.

1000
00:55:27,616 --> 00:55:30,694
Ndiyo, leo ni siku ya mwisho.

1001
00:55:30,718 --> 00:55:33,322
Nitakuwa na hamu sana.

1002
00:55:33,345 --> 00:55:37,312
Asante sana kwa mwaka mzima, kweli.

1003
00:55:37,335 --> 00:55:40,747
Asante pia mimi.

1004
00:55:40,770 --> 00:55:45,024
Uwepo wako, Ali, ulinisaidia sana.

1005
00:55:45,047 --> 00:55:47,014
Asante sana.

1006
00:55:47,037 --> 00:55:50,052
Nimefurahi sana kufanya kazi hapa.

1007
00:55:50,075 --> 00:55:53,842
Ali, utakuwa mtu mzuri katika jamii.

1008
00:55:53,865 --> 00:55:56,432
Ndiyo, nitajitahidi.

1009
00:55:56,455 --> 00:55:59,988
Meneja, asante sana kweli.

1010
00:56:00,011 --> 00:56:04,645
Kazi yako nchini Japani ilikuwa uzoefu mzuri?

1011
00:56:04,669 --> 00:56:07,902
Ndiyo, sitausahau kamwe.

1012
00:56:07,925 --> 00:56:10,560
Ilikuwa uzoefu mzuri sana kweli.

1013
00:56:10,583 --> 00:56:14,550
Kama ukikumbana na matatizo, karibu wakati wowote.

1014
00:56:14,573 --> 00:56:16,773
Ndiyo, asante.

1015
00:56:16,796 --> 00:56:19,283
Naweza kuja kutembelea?

1016
00:56:19,307 --> 00:56:21,640
Bila shaka!

1017
00:56:21,663 --> 00:56:23,930
Tunakuwaita wakati wowote.

1018
00:56:23,953 --> 00:56:27,199
Ndiyo, nitakuja tena bila shaka.

1019
00:56:27,223 --> 00:56:29,090
Kwa heri.

1020
00:56:29,114 --> 00:56:30,514
Kwa heri.

1021
00:56:30,537 --> 00:56:32,170
Uwe na afya.

1022
00:56:32,193 --> 00:56:34,626
Ali, uwe na afya pia.

1023
00:56:34,649 --> 00:56:36,541
Asante sana.

1024
00:56:36,565 --> 00:56:38,131
Asante.